# Supervisor-mode instret access with mcounteren enabled.
# Host setup preloads:
# - privilege = Supervisor
# - mcounteren allows instret reads
# Program reads instret into x1, executes one addi, reads instret into x3,
# then halts with wfi so retired-instruction accounting can be checked.
# Expect x1 = 0, x2 = 7, x3 = 2, minstret = 4, instret = 4.
